67					Why this is required:<br />
68					- Deferred tools are not loaded until discovered via {searchToolName}<br />
69					- Calling a deferred tool without first loading it will fail<br />
70				</Tag>
71				<br />
72				<Tag name='searchQueryGuidance'>
73					Describe what capability you need in natural language. The search uses semantic similarity to find the most relevant tools.<br />
74					<br />
75					Examples:<br />
76					- "create a new file" - finds file creation tools<br />
77					- "run jupyter notebook cell" - finds notebook execution tools<br />
78					- "fetch a web page" - finds web fetching tools<br />
79					- "github pull request" - finds GitHub PR tools<br />
80					<br />
81					Prefer broad queries that cover all related tools in a single search. For example, search "github" to find all GitHub tools at once rather than making separate searches for issues and pull requests. Check the availableDeferredTools list below and use it to inform your query.<br />
82				</Tag>
